This test shows the way to add effective QED potentials to your variationally.

- ueh_fg.inp ... Uehling (VP) and Flambaum-Ginges (SE) potentials      
- ueh_pz.inp ... Uehling (VP) and Pyykko-Zhao (SE) potentials
- ueh_fg_light.inp ... Effective QED potentials are deactivated Z < 19,
                       but this input shows how to add Uehling and Flambaum-Ginges
		       potentials to light atoms.

